@startuml SQ05_Forgot_Password
title UC05 - Forgot & Reset Password Sequence Diagram (Code-based Flow)
autonumber "1:"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ActorFontColor #000000
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    GroupBorderColor #000000
}

actor "User" as User #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nForgotPasswordPage.jsx" as ForgotPassPage #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nResetPasswordPage.jsx" as ResetPassPage #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nauthApi.js" as AuthApi #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nAuthController" as AuthController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nAuthServiceImpl" as AuthServiceImpl #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nEmailService" as EmailService #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nPasswordEncoder" as PasswordEncoder #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAccountRepository" as AccountRepository #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nPasswordResetTokenRepository" as ResetTokenRepo #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAuditLogRepository" as AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
database "<<entity>>\nSQL Server (PMS DB)" as DB #7ACFF5

activate User #7ACFF5
== Phase 1: Request Password Reset ==
User -> ForgotPassPage: Enter email address, click "Gửi yêu cầu khôi phục"
activate ForgotPassPage #7ACFF5

ForgotPassPage -> AuthApi: forgotPassword({ email })
activate AuthApi #7ACFF5

AuthApi -> AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password (ForgotPasswordRequest)
activate AuthController #7ACFF5

AuthController -> AuthServiceImpl: processForgotPassword(ForgotPasswordRequest, clientIp)
activate AuthServiceImpl #7ACFF5

AuthServiceImpl -> AccountRepository: findByEmail(email)
activate AccountRepository #7ACFF5
AccountRepository -> DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE email=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountRepository: Account entity (or empty)
deactivate DB
AccountRepository --> AuthServiceImpl: Optional<Account>
deactivate AccountRepository

opt Account exists and Active
    AuthServiceImpl -> AuthServiceImpl: Generate UUID resetToken and expiresAt = NOW() + 15m
    AuthServiceImpl -> ResetTokenRepo: save(PasswordResetToken: tokenHash, account, expiresAt)
    activate ResetTokenRepo #7ACFF5
    ResetTokenRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO password_reset_tokens (...)
    activate DB #7ACFF5
    DB --> ResetTokenRepo: OK
    deactivate DB
    ResetTokenRepo --> AuthServiceImpl: PasswordResetToken entity
    deactivate ResetTokenRepo

    AuthServiceImpl -> EmailService: sendPasswordResetEmail(email, fullName, resetLink)
    activate EmailService #7ACFF5
    EmailService --> AuthServiceImpl: Email dispatched via SMTP
    deactivate EmailService

    AuthServiceImpl -> AuditLogRepo: recordAuditLog(account, 'FORGOT_PASSWORD_REQUESTED', clientIp)
    activate AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
    AuditLogRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (...)
    activate DB #7ACFF5
    DB --> AuditLogRepo: OK
    deactivate DB
    AuditLogRepo --> AuthServiceImpl: OK
    deactivate AuditLogRepo
end

AuthServiceImpl --> AuthController: void (Generic response to prevent email enumeration)
deactivate AuthServiceImpl

AuthController --> AuthApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success("Đã gửi hướng dẫn khôi phục mật khẩu vào email")
deactivate AuthController

AuthApi --> ForgotPassPage: Success message
deactivate AuthApi

ForgotPassPage --> User: Display notification "Vui lòng kiểm tra hộp thư email của bạn"
deactivate ForgotPassPage

== Phase 2: Reset Password via Token Link ==
User -> ResetPassPage: Open link from email, input newPassword & confirmPassword, click "Đặt lại mật khẩu"
activate ResetPassPage #7ACFF5

ResetPassPage -> AuthApi: resetPassword({ token, newPassword, confirmPassword })
activate AuthApi #7ACFF5

AuthApi -> AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password (ResetPasswordRequest)
activate AuthController #7ACFF5

AuthController -> AuthServiceImpl: resetPassword(ResetPasswordRequest, clientIp)
activate AuthServiceImpl #7ACFF5

AuthServiceImpl -> ResetTokenRepo: findByTokenHash(token)
activate ResetTokenRepo #7ACFF5
ResetTokenRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM password_reset_tokens WHERE token_hash=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> ResetTokenRepo: PasswordResetToken entity (or empty)
deactivate DB
ResetTokenRepo --> AuthServiceImpl: Optional<PasswordResetToken>
deactivate ResetTokenRepo

alt Token invalid / already used / expired
    AuthServiceImpl --> AuthController: throw InvalidTokenException("Liên kết khôi phục mật khẩu không hợp lệ hoặc đã hết hạn")
    AuthController --> AuthApi: HTTP 400 Bad Request
    AuthApi --> ResetPassPage: Error message
    ResetPassPage --> User: Display error "Liên kết đã hết hạn hoặc không hợp lệ"
else Valid Token
    AuthServiceImpl -> PasswordEncoder: encode(newPassword)
    activate PasswordEncoder #7ACFF5
    PasswordEncoder --> AuthServiceImpl: hashedNewPassword
    deactivate PasswordEncoder

    AuthServiceImpl -> AccountRepository: account.setPassword(hashedNewPassword), account.setStatus(ACTIVE)
    activate AccountRepository #7ACFF5
    AccountRepository -> DB: UPDATE accounts SET password=?, status=1 WHERE id=?
    activate DB #7ACFF5
    DB --> AccountRepository: OK
    deactivate DB
    AccountRepository --> AuthServiceImpl: OK
    deactivate AccountRepository

    AuthServiceImpl -> ResetTokenRepo: tokenEntity.setUsedAt(NOW())
    activate ResetTokenRepo #7ACFF5
    ResetTokenRepo -> DB: UPDATE password_reset_tokens SET used_at=NOW() WHERE id=?
    activate DB #7ACFF5
    DB --> ResetTokenRepo: OK
    deactivate DB
    ResetTokenRepo --> AuthServiceImpl: OK
    deactivate ResetTokenRepo

    AuthServiceImpl -> AuditLogRepo: recordAuditLog(account, 'RESET_PASSWORD_SUCCESS', clientIp)
    activate AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
    AuditLogRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (...)
    activate DB #7ACFF5
    DB --> AuditLogRepo: OK
    deactivate DB
    AuditLogRepo --> AuthServiceImpl: OK
    deactivate AuditLogRepo

    AuthServiceImpl --> AuthController: void
    deactivate AuthServiceImpl

    AuthController --> AuthApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success("Đặt lại mật khẩu thành công")
    deactivate AuthController

    AuthApi --> ResetPassPage: Success response
    deactivate AuthApi

    ResetPassPage --> User: Display Toast "Đặt lại mật khẩu thành công!", redirect to /login
end

deactivate ResetPassPage
deactivate User
@enduml